osiris-desktop-theme (0.3.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New package osiris-theme-gnome: the GTK 3/4 + libadwaita + GNOME Shell +
    Metacity theme, GtkSourceView schemes, Ptyxis palette, GNOME Terminal
    installer and the osiris-gtk-theme helper — with no Qt/KDE dependencies.
  * osiris-theme-gtk is now a transitional package depending on
    osiris-theme-gnome.
  * osiris-theme-plasma demotes qt5/qt6-style-kvantum from Recommends to
    Suggests, so installing the osiris-desktop-theme metapackage no longer
    pulls in Qt on a GNOME-only system.

 -- Richard Bláha <richardblaha@gmail.com>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200

